* File: !MAKEFILE  for PFM utilities
*
* Usage:
* ------
* MAKE ALL               Build based on timestamps (requires updated $MAKE)
* MAKE PFM,F  (PFM ALL)  Force update of all utilities
* MAKE <util>
*
* Note: Dependencies across PFM, CRC, CYA, GENCFG, and other utilities
*
*04.1.2021  Created MAKEFILE to help build the utilities and keep them
*           in sync with updates to dependencies
*03.23.2024 Added PFMCRC and PFMDUMPOS
*           Renamed PFM128F to PFMPLUSF
*09.06.2026 Changed LINK to LINKW (Link+Wipe)
*
*
ALL:   PFM

PFM:   PFMCOREUP PFM512F PFMPLUSF PFMPROD PFMSYS OUTS PRODIDS \
       PFMCRC PFMDUMPOS

PFMCRC:  PFMCRCO
PFMCRCO:  PFMCRCS PRODIDS OUTS ..\CRC\CRCMAINS
       ASM PFMCRCS,PFMCRCO,,RC
*      WIPE
       LINKW PFMCRCL

PFMDUMPOS:  PFMDUMPOSO
PFMDUMPOSO:   PFMDUMPOSS PRODIDS OUTS
       ASM PFMDUMPOSS,PFMDUMPOSO,,RC
*      WIPE
       LINKW PFMDUMPOSL

PFMCOREUP:  PFMCOREUPO
PFMCOREUPO:   PFMCOREUPS PRODIDS OUTS
       ASM PFMCOREUPS,PFMCOREUPO,,RC
*      WIPE
       LINKW PFMCOREUPL

PFM512F:  PFM512FO
PFM512FO:   PFM512FS PRODIDS OUTS
       ASM PFM512FS,PFM512FO,,RC
*      WIPE
       LINKW PFM512FL

PFMPLUSF:  PFMPLUSFO
PFMPLUSFO:   PFMPLUSFS PRODIDS OUTS
       ASM PFMPLUSFS,PFMPLUSFO,,RC
*      WIPE
       LINKW PFMPLUSFL

PFMPROD:  PFMPRODO
PFMPRODO:   PFMPRODS PRODIDS OUTS
       ASM PFMPRODS,PFMPRODO,,RC
*      WIPE
       LINKW PFMPRODL

PFMSYS:  PFMSYSO
PFMSYSO:  PFMSYSS PRODIDS OUTS ..\CRC\CRCMAINS
       ASM PFMSYSS,PFMSYSO,,RC
*      WIPE
       LINKW PFMSYSL

* EOF
